**claw-code-go** is a Go reimplementation of Anthropic's Claude Code CLI tool — an AI-powered coding assistant with a terminal UI (TUI), multi-provider support, tool execution, and autonomous mode. It
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
### Tech Stack                                                                                                                                                                                          
- **Language:** Go 1.24.2                                                                                                                                                                               
- **TUI Framework:** [Bubble Tea](https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea) + Bubbles (viewport, textarea, spinner, textinput)                                                                        
- **Styling:** Lipgloss + Glamour (markdown rendering)                                                                                                                                                  
- **WASM Runtime:** Wazero (for DeepSeek web auth challenge solving)                                                                                                                                    
- **No external HTTP client library** — uses raw `net/http`                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
---                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
### Directory Structure                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
```                                                                                                                                                                                                     
claw-code-go/                                                                                                                                                                                           
├── cmd/claw-code-go/main.go          # Entry point                                                                                                                                                     
├── internal/                                                                                                                                                                                           
│   ├── api/                          # Provider-agnostic API layer                                                                                                                                     
│   │   ├── provider.go               # APIClient & Provider interfaces                                                                                                                                 
│   │   ├── types.go                  # Message, Tool, StreamEvent types                                                                                                                                
│   │   ├── client.go                 # Base HTTP client for Anthropic-compatible APIs                                                                                                                  
│   │   ├── strip.go                  # Tool-call syntax stripping utilities                                                                                                                            
│   │   ├── toolcall.go               # Tool-call extraction from text                                                                                                                                  
│   │   ├── xml_toolcalls.go          # XML tool-call parsing                                                                                                                                           
│   │   └── providers/                                                                                                                                                                                  
│   │       ├── anthropic/            # Anthropic direct API (SSE)                                                                                                                                      
│   │       ├── openai/               # OpenAI API adapter                                                                                                                                              
│   │       ├── bedrock/              # AWS Bedrock adapter                                                                                                                                             
│   │       ├── vertex/               # GCP Vertex AI adapter                                                                                                                                           
│   │       ├── foundry/              # Azure AI Foundry adapter                                                                                                                                        
│   │       └── deepseek/             # DeepSeek Chat web API (12 files)                                                                                                                                
│   │           ├── provider.go       # Provider adapter with auth/refresh                                                                                                                              
│   │           ├── stream.go         # SSE-parallel batch stream parser                                                                                                                                
│   │           ├── webclient.go      # HTTP client with cookie jar                                                                                                                                     
│   │           ├── wasm_solver.go    # WASM-based Proof-of-Work solver                                                                                                                                 
│                                                                                                                                                                                                       





