[50;H[H
**claw-code-go** is a Go reimplementation of Anthropic's Claude Code CLI tool — an AI-powered coding assistant with a terminal UI (TUI), multi-provider support, tool execution, and autonomous mode. It
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
### Tech Stack                                                                                                                                                                                          
- **Language:** Go 1.24.2                                                                                                                                                                               
- **TUI Framework:** [Bubble Tea](https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea) + Bubbles (viewport, textarea, spinner, textinput)                                                                        
- **Styling:** Lipgloss + Glamour (markdown rendering)                                                                                                                                                  
- **WASM Runtime:** Wazero (for DeepSeek web auth challenge solving)                                                                                                                                    
- **No external HTTP client library** — uses raw `net/http`                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
---                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
