### Key Features                                                                                                                                                                                        

1. **Multi-Provider Support**: Anthropic (direct/OAuth), OpenAI, AWS Bedrock (IAM), GCP Vertex (ADC), Azure Foundry (Managed Identity), DeepSeek Chat (web API with WASM PoW solver)                    

