7. **MCP Integration**: Model Context Protocol support via stdio and SSE transports                                                                                                                     

8. **Rich TUI**: Command palette (Ctrl+P), @-file mentions, todo sidebar, expandable tool cards with inline diffs, session picker, dark/light themes, input history                                     

